{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"web_search","id":"exec-6cf5fe9d-0c14-4b22-a28f-f2532f92c9ec","query":"巴 古文字 字源 巴 甲骨文 蛇 坐人 考释 ...","action":{"type":"search","queries":["巴 古文字 字源 巴 甲骨文 蛇 坐人 考释","吧 巴 phonetic component character dictionary 口 巴声"]},"results":[{"type":"text_result","domain":"dict.variants.moe.edu.tw","ref_id":"turn0search0","snippet":"正 字 | `A00520` 吧 口-04-07 ... 字樣說明 | 右半作「巴」︰形如「巳」中作一豎，寫法參「巴」字。 ... 為英文bar的音譯。 ... 只用於對舉的句型中，表示猶疑、兩難的語氣。","title":"[A00520] 吧 - Ministry of Education 《Dictionary of Chinese Character Varients》2024","url":"https://dict.variants.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=5605"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wiktionary.org","ref_id":"turn0search1","snippet":"* Kangxi Dictionary: page 178, character 4 ... Phono-semantic compound (形聲 / 形声 (xíngshēng)): semantic 口 (kǒu) + phonetic 巴 (OC *praː). ... component |","title":"吧 - Wiktionary, the free dictionary","url":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/%E5%90%A7"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"case.ntu.edu.tw","ref_id":"turn0search2","snippet":"甲骨文中象跽坐之人的字形隸定為「卩」（圖四），而從甲骨文中从「卩」的諸多文字的造字初義來看，如會張口向跽坐之人發號施令的「令」字、象火在跽坐之人上表光明的「光」字、會一人在鼓旁守候，以便擊鼓報告艱險之事的「艱」字、象人跽坐於呈滿食物的食器前就食之形的「即」字，以及象一人跽坐，雙手被銬鎖之形的「執」字等（圖五），「卩」這個構件向來都是明確用於表人跽坐之形的，也因此將上揭主流隸定為「巴」的甲骨字主結構","title":"曾被釋為「巴」的甲骨文字與《說文解字》裡的「巴蛇食象」 - CASE 報科學","url":"https://case.ntu.edu.tw/blog/?p=45051"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"humanum.arts.cuhk.edu.hk","ref_id":"turn0search3","snippet":"略說: 從「口」，「巴」聲，在現代漢語中用作語氣助詞。 ... 詳解: 從「口」，「巴」聲，在現代漢語中用作語氣助詞。 ... 本字庫於「吧」字下錄有7個方言點的讀音 | 詳細資料","title":"漢語多功能字庫 - 字頭 「吧」","url":"https://humanum.arts.cuhk.edu.hk/Lexis/lexi-mf/search.php?word=%E5%90%A7"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"char.hanzistack.com","ref_id":"turn0search4","snippet":"Semantic: 口 Phonetic: 巴 ... Component: 巴","title":"吧 - Chinese Character Explorer","url":"https://char.hanzistack.com/character/%E5%90%A7"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"ctext.org","ref_id":"turn0search5","snippet":"字典出处: | 宋本广韵 (宋本广韵): 页167第21 页167第39 康熙字典 (《康熙字典》，中华书局，1989): 页178第04 辞海 (《辞海》，中华书局，1947): 卷2页6330第7 汉语大字典 (《汉语大字典》，武汉：四川辞书出版社，湖北辞书出版社，1986-1990): 卷1页0596第06表面结构: | 左：口，右：巴。 ... 康熙字典: | 《··》吧：《》普巴切《集韵","title":"吧 - 中國哲學書電子化計劃","url":"https://ctext.org/dictionary.pl?char=%E5%90%A7&if=gb&remap=gb"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"hanzifeed.com","ref_id":"turn0search6","snippet":"It ranks #470 in character frequency (SUBTLEX-CH corpus). ... The key distinguishing feature: 口 vs 爪 (same 巴 component). ... 吧 is composed of: 口","title":"吧 (ba) — Meaning, Stroke Order, HSK 1 | HanziFeed","url":"https://hanzifeed.com/characters/ba-%E5%90%A7/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"dict.revised.moe.edu.tw","ref_id":"turn0search7","snippet":"教育部《重編國語辭典修訂本》您的瀏覽器不支援JavaScript功能，若網頁功能無法正常使用時，請開啟瀏覽器JavaScript狀態 ... ### 3畫/口部+4畫/吧 ... 編號 | 字詞 | 音讀 [Input]注音 [Input]漢語拼音","title":"部首索引 [3畫/口部+4畫/吧] - 教育部《重編國語辭典修訂本》2021","url":"https://dict.revised.moe.edu.tw/searchR.jsp?ID=3&ID=30&ID=4&la=0&powerMode=0&word=%E5%90%A7"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.fobip.com","ref_id":"turn0search8","snippet":"“吧”字左边的“口”表示与说话、口语有关，右边的“巴”为声旁，表音。 ... The left side component '口' signifies relation to mouth/speech, while the right side '巴' is the phonetic indicator. ... The character '吧' consists","title":"学习汉字 \"吧\" (ba) - Learn Chinese Character \"吧\"","url":"https://www.fobip.com/chinese/characters/%E5%90%A7.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"commons.princeton.edu","ref_id":"turn0search9","snippet":"Oh China Lesson 07, 口(radical of mouth) ... * phonetic radical: 巴bā","title":"吧 ba – Basic Chinese Characters of CHI 103 & 108","url":"https://commons.princeton.edu/chinesecharacters/%E5%90%A7/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"ninchanese.com","ref_id":"turn0search10","snippet":"巴 can be used as a phonetic component in a Chinese character.","title":"巴 (Bā) — Ba in Chinese: Phonetic Component & Characters","url":"https://ninchanese.com/chinese-character-components/chinese-character-component-%E5%B7%B4-ba/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.cheng-tsui.com","ref_id":"turn0search12","snippet":"Page with three stacked dictionary-style entries for Chinese characters, each in a bordered panel with a large character box on the left, English explanation in","title":"<visual_element id=\"e1\">","url":"https://www.cheng-tsui.com/sites/default/files/previews/Way%20of%20Chinese%20Characters_2E_Sample.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"downloads.freemdict.com","ref_id":"turn0search13","snippet":"甲骨文簡明詞典》42頁、73頁)。 ... 【按】章炳麟《文始》：“《說文》無蟒，蓋本作葩，古音葩如蛇，借為巴也。”黃約齋《字源》：“兄的變體，用手指表示爬伏，後字形變成‘巴’。” ... 古人以“斷髮文身”為野蠻人，故年長者頭髮長；又，年長者受尊重，故又有“長老”(名詞)之意，春秋齊魯等諸銘文中，“老”字頭帶冠狀，長老之意極為明顯。","title":"基础汉字形义释源 《说文》部首今读本义（修订本）","url":"https://downloads.freemdict.com/100G_Super_Big_Collection/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8D%8E%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B9%A6/%E5%8F%A4%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97/%E5%9F%BA%E7%A4%8E%E6%BC%A2%E5%AD%97%E5%BD%A2%E7%BE%A9%E9%87%8B%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%88%E4%BF%AE%E8%A8%82%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89%E9%84%92%E6%9B%89%E9%BA%97%E7%B7%A8%C2%B7%E4%B8%AD%E8%8F%AF%E6%9B%B8%E5%B1%802007.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"charbzaban.com","ref_id":"turn0search14","snippet":"Character entry for 巴 with a stroke-order/component grid.","title":"Reading and Writing Chinese","url":"https://charbzaban.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/William_McNaughton_Jiageng_Fan_Reading_and_Writ_b-ilovepdf-compressed.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.nlc.cn","ref_id":"turn0search15","snippet":"远古时期，人类穴居，蛇更是常见，所以象形字“蛇”字在3000多年前的甲骨文里就已出现了。 ... ④1965年，著名学者张政烺在《释甲骨文“俄”、“秉”、“蠶”三字》⑤一文中首次纠正此字为“蚕”的旧说，认为此字是“一种短蛇”的象形。 ... ①《睡虎地秦墓竹简》“日书甲种”“盗者篇”记载了十二地支占盗法，也就是某地支日会有相应的什么长相的人偷盗、偷的东西藏在哪里等。 ... ⑥《古文字研究》第一辑","title":"文津流觞　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　2025年第1期","url":"https://www.nlc.cn/upload/attachments/2025-01-21/17034e7f.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.reddit.com","ref_id":"turn0reddit16","snippet":"* a list of all hanzi containing the phonetic component, organised by their pronunciation. ... * 巴 = ba1345 pa2 (ba1 巴, ba3 把, ba4","title":"List of all phonetic components used in Chinese characters?","url":"https://www.reddit.com/r/ChineseLanguage/comments/k6i10u"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"mitocw.ups.edu.ec","ref_id":"turn0search17","snippet":"b) 字 zì ‘character’ contains 子 zĭ (‘child’) as phonetic; think ‘a pupil under a roof, ... f) Like many of the other final particles","title":"第三課  Dì-sān kè","url":"https://mitocw.ups.edu.ec/courses/global-studies-and-languages/21g-107-chinese-i-streamlined-fall-2014/study-materials/MIT21G_107F14_Chars3.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search18","snippet":"In Modern Standard Chinese usage, ba 巴 often transcribes foreign loanword s such as ba 巴 \"bar (unit)\", Bali 巴黎 \"Paris\", or Guba 古巴 \"Cuba\".","title":"Bashe","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bashe"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"zh.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search19","snippet":"口部為漢字索引中的部首之一，通稱口字旁，計三畫，是康熙字典214個部首中的第30個（三畫的中為第1個）。 ... 口部下的漢字大多與嘴巴、說話或聲音有關或者是擬聲字、音譯用字。","title":"口部 (部首)","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8F%A3%E9%83%A8_%28%E9%83%A8%E9%A6%96%29"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.mobt3ath.com","ref_id":"turn0search20","snippet":"Only three groups has all four phonetic component analogy types, denoted type 1234 in Figure 4.22, including (古) 胡湖/古姑故/苦/做個, (巴) 巴吧/把爸/爬/肥, and (青) 青清/晴情/精睛/請/猜. ...","title":"Developing orthographic awareness among beginning Chinese language learners: investigating the influence of beginning level textbooks","url":"https://www.mobt3ath.com/uplode/book/book-23618.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"de.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search21","snippet":"巴 | bā | bā 吧 把 ... 口 (*kʰoːʔ) | 口 叩 扣 釦 筘 ... 巴 (*praː) | 巴 芭 笆 豝 鈀","title":"Liste von Phonetika in chinesischen Schriftzeichen","url":"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liste_von_Phonetika_in_chinesischen_Schriftzeichen"}]}}
